---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Google Reviews Terms & Privacy | Flores Landscaping">
  <div id="top"></div><Header />
  <main id="main" class="container section-pad review-policy">
    <div class="eyebrow">WEBSITE INFORMATION</div>
    <h1>Google reviews<br /><em>Terms & privacy</em></h1>
    <h2>Using the review feature</h2>
    <p>The Google reviews feature is subject to the <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Terms of Service</a>, which are incorporated into these terms. Reviews reflect the opinions of their authors. Displaying them does not imply an endorsement by Google.</p>
    <h2>How reviews are selected</h2>
    <p>Google provides up to five reviews selected by relevance. We display five-star written reviews from that selection, ordered by publication date, newest first. This is a selection of reviews, rather than a complete review history. Follow the Google Maps links to read the source reviews and view the business profile.</p>
    <h2>Privacy for this feature</h2>
    <p>When you approach the reviews section, our server requests reviews from Google. This request identifies the business; it does not send your contact-form information to Google. Reviewer names, profile images, profile links, review text, and dates are displayed when available.</p>
    <p>Profile images load from Google in your browser. Google may receive your IP address and browser information when images load or you follow Google links. The <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a> is incorporated into this feature’s privacy policy. This review feature does not use browser storage to retain reviews, and we do not maintain a stored copy of Google’s review responses.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about this feature, contact <a href="mailto:floreslandscaping098@gmail.com">floreslandscaping098@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/#reviews">BACK TO CUSTOMER REVIEWS →</a>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .review-policy { max-width: 860px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  h2 { font-size: 1.55rem; margin-top: 35px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  p { margin-block: 16px; color: var(--muted); }
  p a { text-decoration: underline; color: var(--red); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .text-link { margin-top: 30px; }
</style>
